# ACASH — Alpaca PAPER credential template (PAPER-ONLY).
#
# This file is the COMMITTED template (placeholders only). It contains NO secret
# material and MUST never hold a real credential.
#
# To wire up paper credentials:
#   1. Copy this file to `.env`  (which IS gitignored — never commit it).
#   2. Fill in the two values with YOUR Alpaca PAPER account key id + secret.
#      Use the Alpaca *paper* account keys ONLY. Never paste live keys here.
#   3. The fail-closed Paper Credential Guard (credentials.py) will refuse to
#      construct a paper credential if these are absent, and will REJECT any
#      live/other venue on the paper path.
#
# These env var names are read by EnvAlpacaCredentialProvider and consumed by the
# paper transport for Basic auth. They are NEVER logged or serialized into
# canonical events/evidence, and never resolved from repo files — only from the
# environment/secret store (credential contract §6 C-1/C-2).
#
# PAPER ONLY. No live endpoint or live credential belongs on this path.

ACASH_ALPACA_API_KEY_ID=
ACASH_ALPACA_API_SECRET=
